category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libQt5Core5 libstdc++6 libuchardet0
sdesc: "Cross-platform IRC framework written with Qt (runtime)"
ldesc: "Communi is a cross-platform IRC framework written with Qt. Communi provides a
set of tools for enabling IRC connectivity in Qt-based C++ and QML
applications."
external-source: libcommuni

